  "source_sha256": "52365d41b6b2c921057a20b877bfda4ff37e2450456a6425341774fd6b16df5b",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ebd0df7e4ecda01b405680514f969ea374b520e1aeb972444d30bd3b764b3418",
      "text": "Wukong’s Missing\nPicnic Cup",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "293b3983ff666080058b790dbcd678f7a3b1874f83a95a42da527c34a5ade107",
      "text": "It is picnic day!\nWukong carries a basket of\ncups.\n“I will set the cups!”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2ad111fa43b44b857db1e3f2626866b52495e99d64bb72f72e76cdd56a1d8a0a",
      "text": "His friends walk up the hill.\nPigsy, Rabbit, Ao Bing and\nIron Fan!\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "db4992eadb49dca60ed20ca9f089b93f2def9816baff5093aac40eb9ddd22e07",
      "text": "Wukong counts his friends.\n“One, two, three, four.”\n“Four friends!”\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "42f6be9381a53a05c4fb670a4daf6ebcb1301c2411111a01d750d589f05af5e2",
      "text": "He takes cups from the\nbasket.\n“One cup for you, Pigsy.”\n“One cup for you, Rabbit.”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3367fe44091b561289e5f2a2bb3fc948fa836d1a1d3e5d28231f67374e3129cd",
      "text": "“One cup for you, Ao Bing.”\n“One cup for you, Iron Fan.”\n“Four friends. Four cups.\nDone!”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "70dcb8d29a8faae44723b28adfe577499ed075b5cb6628604833e49f7a2762ae",
      "text": "Iron Fan pours peach juice.\nWukong sits down, too.\nBut his hands are empty.\n“Hey! Where is my cup?”\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f8b8f4eaf6b8f4fc4c1c78cdf684e87eb87f646860c5d546228e4623d99933d9",
      "text": "Wukong looks under the mat.\n“Not here!”\nPigsy looks behind the tree.\n“Not here!”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "27cea34ecd12213735199d068973f2f79033cb557ac497cf21f71b08477bb35b",
      "text": "Iron Fan waves her fan.\nWhoosh! Leaves fly up.\n“Oops—too much!”\nNo cup in the tree.\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "99c3cd9e101c111c603c3471e81d32167d54065a9f21294b76d008ce0e337c31",
      "text": "Ao Bing asks, “How many\ncups?”\n“Let’s count. One, two, three,\nfour.”\n“The last number is four.\nSo we have four cups.”\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "10fc2b9f0d2ec2514e3c36fd5e9fc0370d314784d1df0cfa43d78fb9a5480a65",
      "text": "Rabbit asks, “How many\nfriends?”\nWukong points.\n“One, two, three, four.”\nThen everyone points at him!\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5e1c449621123a88abae74261e59ec75e4b3472d0842363ca824f6ae05e7573",
      "text": "“Oh! Me, too!”\nWukong taps his chest.\n“I am a friend, too. Five!”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "80cd6694fbe258ca5d1b5ba71d9792365d2579aa28ac05cd65f91cb8cc1326ea",
      "text": "He gets one more cup from\nthe basket.\n“One cup for me!”\n“One, two, three, four, five.\nFive friends. Five cups.”\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6ce8be3517314849e55008dee46a687461e79d8f660c5eb2c764d9e60fe62240",
      "text": "Pigsy pats his round tummy.\n“Can my tummy have a seat,\ntoo?”\nRabbit laughs.\n“Tummies don’t need cups!”\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c4d84155695b7ba4c5c8ad09a9fca13790afe2b76c590c30cae82664095e1125",
      "text": "Five cups go up.\nClink, clink, clink, clink, clink!\nFive friends sip peach juice.\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "53f30a65bc26f0b1d1639ae70c8af76c586f9f5503b08f9b3eebae422021f7bb",
      "text": "After the picnic, Wukong\npacks the basket.\n“One, two, three, four, five.”\n“Next time, I count me first!”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
